{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"本杰明·富兰克林·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"benjamin-franklin","categoryLabel":"本杰明·富兰克林","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/05_benjamin-franklin/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代表成就\">代表成就</h1><p>本卷聚焦本杰明·富兰克林<strong>留下的具体&quot;作品&quot;</strong>——那些可以被翻开、被引用、被参观、至今仍在运转的东西：两部传世著述（《富兰克林自传》《穷理查年鉴》），一项改变人类与雷电关系的科学—工程成就（避雷针与电学），以及一批延续近三百年的公共机构。换言之，本卷回答的是&quot;富兰克林<strong>做出了什么可触摸的产物</strong>&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷-如何分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷：如何分工</h2><p>富兰克林的内容被拆成六卷，彼此分工明确，避免重复。读本卷前，请先明确它与邻卷的边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他何时、在何地、经历了什么</td>\n<td>提供时间线背景；本卷只取与&quot;作品&quot;相关的片段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他实际促成了哪些事（含建国、外交）</td>\n<td>偏&quot;事件 / 功业&quot;；本卷偏&quot;留下的成品&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他如何思考、信奉何种价值</td>\n<td>提供&quot;操作系统&quot;；本卷是这套思想的<strong>产物</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>4 代表成就（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>他做出了什么可触摸的作品</td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这些成就身后如何被重塑、争论</td>\n<td>偏&quot;身后效应&quot;；本卷偏&quot;作品本身&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>如何辩证评判他的功过</td>\n<td>提供批判视角；本卷只在必要处点到</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>核心贡献偏&quot;他干成的事&quot;，本卷偏&quot;他留下的物&quot;；思想与方法是源代码，本卷是编译出的产品。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷三章结构\">本卷三章结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;第1章 自传&lt;br/&gt;自我塑造的范本&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;共同主线&lt;br/&gt;&#39;把才智用于造福世人&#39;&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;第2章 穷理查年鉴&lt;br/&gt;智慧的大众传播&quot;] --&gt; D&#10;    C[&quot;第3章 科学与公共成就&lt;br/&gt;科学+组织造福公众&quot;] --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"第1章 自传&lt;br/&gt;自我塑造的范本\"] --&gt; D[\"共同主线&lt;br/&gt;'把才智用于造福世人'\"]\n    B[\"第2章 穷理查年鉴&lt;br/&gt;智慧的大众传播\"] --&gt; D\n    C[\"第3章 科学与公共成就&lt;br/&gt;科学+组织造福公众\"] --&gt; D</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章《富兰克林自传》</strong>——<a href=\"autobiography/the-autobiography\">文本史与结构</a> 讲这部书&quot;怎么写成、为何残缺&quot;；<a href=\"autobiography/a-model-of-self-making\">自我塑造的典范</a> 讲它&quot;制造了什么神话&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章《穷理查年鉴》</strong>——<a href=\"poor-richards-almanack/the-almanack\">年鉴的商业机制</a> 讲它作为&quot;载体&quot;如何畅销与传播；<a href=\"poor-richards-almanack/aphorisms\">箴言与格言</a> 讲它装载的&quot;内容&quot;及其来源、技法与误传。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 科学与公共成就</strong>——<a href=\"scientific-civic-legacy/the-lightning-rod\">避雷针与电学</a> 讲&quot;用科学造福公众&quot;；<a href=\"scientific-civic-legacy/civic-institutions\">公共机构的奠基</a> 讲&quot;用组织造福公众&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>想读其人精神内核</strong>：先 <a href=\"autobiography/a-model-of-self-making\">自传 › 自我塑造的典范</a> → <a href=\"poor-richards-almanack/aphorisms\">箴言与格言</a>，再回看 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>想看其硬核成就</strong>：直接 <a href=\"scientific-civic-legacy/the-lightning-rod\">避雷针与电学</a> → <a href=\"scientific-civic-legacy/civic-institutions\">公共机构的奠基</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>想做文本研究</strong>：<a href=\"autobiography/the-autobiography\">自传 › 文本史</a> → <a href=\"poor-richards-almanack/the-almanack\">年鉴 › 商业机制</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>前置建议</strong>：本卷可独立阅读，但若先浏览 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 的时间线，对各作品的成书背景会理解得更顺。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>读完本卷，再去 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 看这些作品身后两个世纪的命运，以及 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a> 中它们被批评的一面，即可获得一个有褒有贬、立体完整的富兰克林。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"autobiography","title":"自传","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/autobiography","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-autobiography","title":"《富兰克林自传》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/autobiography/the-autobiography"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-model-of-self-making","title":"自我塑造的典范","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/autobiography/a-model-of-self-making"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"poor-richards-almanack","title":"穷理查年鉴","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/poor-richards-almanack","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-almanack","title":"《穷理查年鉴》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/poor-richards-almanack/the-almanack"},{"seq":2,"slug":"aphorisms","title":"箴言与格言","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/poor-richards-almanack/aphorisms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"scientific-civic-legacy","title":"科学与公共成就","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/scientific-civic-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-lightning-rod","title":"避雷针与电学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/scientific-civic-legacy/the-lightning-rod"},{"seq":2,"slug":"civic-institutions","title":"公共机构的奠基","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/benjamin-franklin/major-works/scientific-civic-legacy/civic-institutions"}]}]}